{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":15,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:026e49a1eca7ad227556f3a8ec4e23f430114f4da45200a29386947cbd2fdb80","mono_ns":16000000,"prev":"sha256:bd1ff1de125b7c87f237e73d9dbf6af0b38d45ecb5f87415e03d8a440b2076d2","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":16,"session":"7dc67003-583e-4dd3-98fe-203f6b820a16","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.016Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
